window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My magic is evolving, unpredictable, and wild. What once exhausted me now flows through my veins like an addiction.</b></p> <p>Ancient texts whisper of vampires like me. They don't mention the hunger that comes with the power, or that being hunted is my new normal.</p> <p>Silvergate Academy isn't what we thought. The professors track my progress too meticulously. Record every surge of my abilities too carefully.</p> <p>Beneath the academy lies a sanctuary of ancient magic and even older secrets. My family didn't hide me for twenty-one years out of love.</p> <p>They hid me out of fear.</p> <p>As my powers intensify, so does the attention of those who've been waiting centuries for someone exactly like me.</p> <p><i>This dark paranormal romance is book two in a reverse harem romance series by</i> USA Today<i> bestselling author Eve Newton. For mature listeners.</i></p>"; 
